div.p:
This Swiss draft is the final step in the preparation of the Swiss
                    counter-project, and I venture for your convenience to cite the references to
                    the various reports which I have made and which it may be found advantageous to
                    consider as a whole. The list follows: 

335 of March 8, 1928;

358 of March 18, 1928;

387 of April 4, 1928;

415 of April 24, 1928;

423 of May 5, 1928.
